    "composition_notes": "Slow 60 BPM Aeolian lament in A minor using the POKEY 8-bit bass register (root notes kept within the C3-C4 playable window). The harmony voice stays silent through the intro and the martial B1 to leave room for the drums and bass, then returns for A2, B2 and A3. Percussion is a sparse heartbeat in the A sections and a full march in B. The B section borrows the Phrygian b2 (Bb) and ends on an E7 dominant to pull the piece back to the tonic."
